### Set baseUrl, email and password in http-client.private.env.json.
### Store accessToken and refreshToken privately after login/refresh; never commit them.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"{{email}}","password":"{{password}}","displayName":"Local Keycloak User"}

### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"{{email}}","password":"{{password}}"}

### Account
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Rotate; use both new tokens from the response, and discard both old tokens.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{"refreshToken":"{{refreshToken}}"}

### Logout current session
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
